{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":156013,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793388371970,"status":"ok","value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2023,"episodeCount":11,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/68xwQgBGqsMKxN6VElzUW9rbzRg.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"3458924","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A phenomenon called the Snow Sea engulfed the surface world, and only a handful of people now reside high above the Snow Sea. When Kaina, one of the members of the last remaining village, goes on a hunt, he finds something entirely unexpected...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-01-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":6.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rDJNJgWZgW09skZhzVQg6ArMcSP.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rDJNJgWZgW09skZhzVQg6ArMcSP.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/156013/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"4152868","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kaina and the other villagers find out for the first time that there is life below the Canopy. Ririha, princess of Atland, explains that she came from the Snow Sea in search of \"the sage,\" who may be able to help with their water shortage issue.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-01-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aPY2XuSwuWAXbJQO3R8TR07Yqjy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aPY2XuSwuWAXbJQO3R8TR07Yqjy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/156013/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"4152869","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"In order to safely return Ririha to her nation, Kaina goes with her to assist their climb down the spire tree, knowing he will not be able to return to his village again. Their travel goes smoothly, but the Valghians were waiting for Ririha at the base.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-01-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sk6rneCuQMqOtI6GuaVGEVMWphE.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sk6rneCuQMqOtI6GuaVGEVMWphE.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/156013/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"4152870","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Valghians capture Ririha so they can strongarm the Atlandians into surrendering. The Atlandian soldiers engage in the battle to rescue Ririha and Kaina, but aren't successful. Ririha manages to free Kaina while she remains in captivity.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-02-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2O2L0Wpr4QD2LLesx05iVEUbfLn.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2O2L0Wpr4QD2LLesx05iVEUbfLn.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/156013/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"4159417","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After learning of the King of Atland's decision to not rescue Ririha and instead go to war with Valghia, it's up to Kaina and Yaona to go save Ririha. Without a means to travel the sea, they must figure out an alternative way to get there.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2023-02-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/thWwV1kn2yyu2TGl4qE13sQoXw.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/thWwV1kn2yyu2TGl4qE13sQoXw.jpg